          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Ginsburg asked how the Court\u2019s settled line of decisions regarding punitive damages in maritime law was reached."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0000-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Chief Justice Roberts asked whether a shareholder must be driving the ship before liability can be assessed."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0000-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 12,
              "start": 12
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Ginsburg, justice Ginsburg inquired whether the railroad case dealt with respondeat\u2011superior and distinguished between regular and managerial employees."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Stevens",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0000-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 14,
              "start": 14
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Stevens asked whether hiring an obviously incompetent crew member could justify punitive damages."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0001-0004"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 30,
              "start": 30
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked what additional factors, beyond due\u2011process cases, should be considered in a punitive\u2011damages framework for maritime law."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 43,
              "start": 43
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked whether a managerial agent is liable if he violated express instructions from an employer."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0003-0000"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 60,
              "start": 60
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Scalia asked about the relevance of the Clean Water Act to the case."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "District Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-06abfc191925-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 64,
              "start": 64
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The district court held that the Trans\u2011Alaska Pipeline Authorization Act (TAPAA) controls spills of trans\u2011Alaska oil and its savings clause expressly preserves the ability to seek punitive damages."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
            "evidence_ids": [
