            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts noted that the case was submitted after oral argument."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
