              "pages": {
                "end": 38,
                "start": 38
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Mr. Fisher (Respondents), according to Mr. Fisher (Respondents), it is appropriate to expose the corporation to punitive damages based on the reckless acts of an individual."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-06abfc191925-0004-0002"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 77,
                "start": 77
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, by definition this is a mandatory punitive class, the only time Exxon will face punitive damages."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-06abfc191925-0004-0004"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 79,
                "start": 79
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, the Ninth Circuit held Exxon could be liable for $2.5\u202fbillion because Captain Hazelwood left the deck against company policy."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-06abfc191925-0004-0005"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 80,
                "start": 80
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Petitioners, compensatory damages were $400\u2013$500 times the amount considered substantial by the Ninth Circuit."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Petitioners",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "06abfc1919250924dbc7899aee54290e0f6de6cb6debf2707241dd9ea79f6793",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-06abfc191925-0004-0006"
